 [size=22][b]The [color=#475577]Color[/color][/b][/size]

[align=center][img alt="Colors FINAL" width=800 height=368]https://i.looksmax.org/attachments/2018/12/1417764_Colors-FINAL.png[/img][/align]

 [b]Dark brown or black is ideal[/b], since they make your brows look more dense. If you're the blonde phenotype with blonde eyebrows that are hardly visible, you should try to dye them to a slightly darker shade after you tried the stuff I listed below..

 [size=22][b]The [color=#475577]Growth[/color][/b][/size]

 [size=15]If you have thin eyebrows you can[/size]

[list]
[*][b]use [url="https://www.livestrong.com/article/280227-how-to-grow-eyebrows-with-minoxidil/"]minoxidil[/url][/b]
[*][b]use [url="https://www.healthline.com/health/castor-oil-for-eyebrows#1"]castor oil[/url][/b]
[*][b]use [url="https://nonaeyemd.com/2014/08/30/what-is-latisse-and-how-does-it-work/"]latisse[/url][/b]
[*][b]do [url="https://simpleskincarescience.com/dermarolling/"]microneedling[/url] in combination with castor oil or [url="https://www.elle.com/uk/beauty/skin/a35378/what-is-hyaluronic-acid-and-how-does-it-work/"]hyaluron[/url][/b]
[*][b]get an [url="https://www.realself.com/eyebrow-transplant"]eyebrow transplant[/url][/b]
[*][b]use an [url="https://www.mensmake-up.co.uk/eyes/brow-gels-for-men.html"]eyebrow pencil[/url] for men [emote name=":feelsmega:" label="FeelsMega"][/b]
[*][b]check out [umention name="SquareChinOrDeath" uid=576] 's thread [url="https://looksmax.org/threads/regrow-your-hair-follicles-androgenic-alopecia-no-excuses-after-youve-read-this-tbh-ngl.4678/#post-74103"]here[/url][/b]
[/list]

 [size=22][b]The [color=#475577]Grooming[/color][/b][/size]

 So if you have [b]thick and dense eyebrows now[/b], you can start shaping them. This can be made with a tweezer or a blade, I recommend using a tweezer first if you never shaped your eyebrows before. Don't use a blade for outer eyebrows.

 Pick the hairs where your brows start to arch down, if you want to make them straighter. If you want a positive tilt you need to grow hairs on the right area.

 Make sure they are symmetrical. When I shape my eyebrows I use a reversed mirror to spot asymmetry more effectively, but you can use a normal mirror too.

 Don't overdo your eyebrows in case you don't want to look gay. You can avoid looking like the guy below by keeping some hairs around your eyebrows. This is why I said you shouldn't use a blade for outer brows:

[align=center][img alt="The apprentice 2013 Alex 590x350" width=590 height=350]https://i.looksmax.org/attachments/2018/12/1417766_The-apprentice-2013-Alex-590x350.jpg[/img][/align]

 You can brush your eyebrows and wax them. I do this daily and it doesn't look tryhard aslong you don't use too much.of it. It gives a more neat look.

 If you are done reshaping and grooming, take a picture if you like, so you can take it as a sample when new hairs start to grow out.

[align=center][size=22]Thanks for reading.[/size]

